      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PARADISE FUSION (2) is a first starter from the Wesley McDonald kennel by Zipping Kyrgios out of Fusion Split. Gets every chance from the inside draw. Expected to be well fancied and can make an immediate impact. MANTON ROAD (1) hit the ground running with a slick early sectional but ran over late and missed the frame when a 1.75 lengths fifth (20.57) over 350m at Goulburn. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. HACKSAW DES (8) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (19.17) at this track behind Rick's Rosie in a Maiden. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Will give a great sight again. LATTE CARGO (4) can measure up with the right run.",
